+The `createRentalService()` API exported from `src/index.ts` provides an in-memory inventory and booking desk. Add boards or sails with a daily price in integer euro cents, then use `quote({ itemId, start, end })` to get the total or `book(...)` to reserve the equipment. Daily rental timestamps are UTC ISO-8601 midnights; the end is exclusive and is the midnight after the final rental day. Equipment may also be added with an optional `hourlyPrice` in integer euro cents. Rentals shorter than a day can use whole-hour UTC boundaries and cost `hourlyPrice` per hour; equipment without `hourlyPrice` cannot be rented for less than a day. A booking fails if that equipment is already booked during any part of the period. Each service instance starts with an empty inventory and booking list.
 
 Rentals of three days or more receive a 10% discount on the full rental price. The discounted total is returned by `quote()` and stored on the resulting booking. Discounted totals are rounded to the nearest euro cent.
 
